privacy-text = Messages pass through Telegram and the bot before encryption. After saving, the owner cannot read the secret again; recovery restores management only. Deleting removes service data through cleanup, but does not recall received copies or instantly erase older backups. Never share your recovery key or guardian codes with support. This build accepts synthetic data only.
